ph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/5235e1e5ff824abefd3b84ffd63cc588.avif?t=1753338297\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/bfd45747b49cc2b4d9aa06180a03965f.poster.avif?t=1753338297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/bfd45747b49cc2b4d9aa06180a03965f.webm?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/bfd45747b49cc2b4d9aa06180a03965f.mp4?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Season 3 focuses on enhancing guild content with the theme of <strong><u>Synergy</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly promote your guild and recruit new members through the Guild Recruitment Board, and use the newly updated guild quests and guild store buff to elevate your guild to new heights.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/38cbd2535f3026057285ad0e9717184f.poster.avif?t=1753338297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/38cbd2535f3026057285ad0e9717184f.webm?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/38cbd2535f3026057285ad0e9717184f.mp4?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every major map is home to formidable bosses, with even more powerful ones lurking in dungeons. Team up with your guildmates to defeat these bosses and rise to become one of the top guilds in the DK Online world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/bdc2bac0e63b52381ead4566b2b73d1a.avif?t=1753338297\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/8857120b46384c23d7eefa8eef565d09.poster.avif?t=1753338297\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/8857120b46384c23d7eefa8eef565d09.webp?t=1753338297\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/14e5f53a5c30ce5a5d83d335194fc3ce.poster.avif?t=1753338297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/14e5f53a5c30ce5a5d83d335194fc3ce.webm?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Every DK Online player can enjoy challenges and unlock <u>amazing <strong>rewards for free!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn premium items, high-level weapons, and powerful gear as you complete various tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New to DK Online?</strong> No worries\u2014progress through achievements step by step, grow stronger, and unlock rewards along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/11d186766ecf7820bf021a13b1747e88.avif?t=1753338297\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/b2c4881bdf1c45d7de0efa6a9e0d43b2.poster.avif?t=1753338297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/b2c4881bdf1c45d7de0efa6a9e0d43b2.webm?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/b2c4881bdf1c45d7de0efa6a9e0d43b2.mp4?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform into over <strong><u>100 different monsters, bosses, and characters</u></strong> with just a click\u2014no need for individual customization! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While our special Christmas outfits help you celebrate the season, new character transformations keep things fresh with each passing season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of DK Online, transform into stunning and fierce looks, and conquer the world in festive style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/bb9a341b7b732d21dc80ff1d6e3467de.avif?t=1753338297\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/3bb2eb434a9416836c7e66e1e35674bc.poster.avif?t=1753338297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/3bb2eb434a9416836c7e66e1e35674bc.webm?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/3bb2eb434a9416836c7e66e1e35674bc.mp4?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the expansive world of DK Online, conquer unique monsters, and complete quests across diverse hunting grounds and dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by medieval European history, the game offers a realistic fantasy experience with high-quality graphics and efficient client size. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enjoy a meticulously crafted classic MMORPG adventure!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/5235e1e5ff824abefd3b84ffd63cc588.avif?t=1753338297\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/bfd45747b49cc2b4d9aa06180a03965f.poster.avif?t=1753338297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/bfd45747b49cc2b4d9aa06180a03965f.webm?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/bfd45747b49cc2b4d9aa06180a03965f.mp4?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Season 3 focuses on enhancing guild content with the theme of <strong><u>Synergy</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly promote your guild and recruit new members through the Guild Recruitment Board, and use the newly updated guild quests and guild store buff to elevate your guild to new heights.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/38cbd2535f3026057285ad0e9717184f.poster.avif?t=1753338297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/38cbd2535f3026057285ad0e9717184f.webm?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/38cbd2535f3026057285ad0e9717184f.mp4?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every major map is home to formidable bosses, with even more powerful ones lurking in dungeons. Team up with your guildmates to defeat these bosses and rise to become one of the top guilds in the DK Online world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/bdc2bac0e63b52381ead4566b2b73d1a.avif?t=1753338297\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/8857120b46384c23d7eefa8eef565d09.poster.avif?t=1753338297\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/8857120b46384c23d7eefa8eef565d09.webp?t=1753338297\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/14e5f53a5c30ce5a5d83d335194fc3ce.poster.avif?t=1753338297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/781030/extras/14e5f53a5c30ce5a5d83d335194fc3ce.webm?t=1753338297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Every DK Online player can enjoy challenges and unlock <u>amazing <strong>rewards for free!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn premium items, high-level weapons, and powerful gear as you complete various tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New to DK Online?</strong> No worries\u2014progress through achievements step by step, grow stronger, and unlock rewards along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai